{
    "title": "Coloring games for kids: 2-5 y",
    "description": "Kids coloring and drawing! For ages 2 to 6\r\nGlow doodle & Animated coloring pages\r\nApp is designed to be educational, creativity booster for artistic kids!\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n\u25ba Toddler coloring mode\r\n\u25ba Drawing mode - simplified for kids\r\n\u25ba 80+ Coloring pages with Sounds and Animations\r\n\u25ba 9 different categories: Dinosaurs, Animals, Fish, Farm... \r\n\u25ba Playable Offline\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAdditional features: \r\n\r\nTouch Protection - Kids can hold the device and color comfortably\r\n\u25ba Kids with their small hands often need to hold tablets and phones with their thumb on active area of the screen. With this in mind, our app supports this and it's more comfortable to play around for children\r\n\r\nParental Gate - Purchases and settings are inaccessible for small kids\r\n\u25ba Settings window, external links and purchases are protected by \"Parental Gate\", so that our young users won't get confused and lost in the places where they're not supposed to be\r\n\r\n\u25ba Completely Ads Free - your kids won't see any ads in the app",
    "descriptionHTML": "Kids coloring and drawing! For ages 2 to 6<br>Glow doodle &amp; Animated coloring pages<br>App is designed to be educational, creativity booster for artistic kids!<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>\u25ba Toddler coloring mode<br>\u25ba Drawing mode - simplified for kids<br>\u25ba 80+ Coloring pages with Sounds and Animations<br>\u25ba 9 different categories: Dinosaurs, Animals, Fish, Farm... <br>\u25ba Playable Offline<br><br><br><br>Additional features: <br><br>Touch Protection - Kids can hold the device and color comfortably<br>\u25ba Kids with their small hands often need to hold tablets and phones with their thumb on active area of the screen. With this in mind, our app supports this and it&#39;s more comfortable to play around for children<br><br>Parental Gate - Purchases and settings are inaccessible for small kids<br>\u25ba Settings window, external links and purchases are protected by &quot;Parental Gate&quot;, so that our young users won&#39;t get confused and lost in the places where they&#39;re not supposed to be<br><br>\u25ba Completely Ads Free - your kids won&#39;t see any ads in the app",
